[00:17.34]1. There is a need in each heart
[00:22.56]God put within from the start:
[00:27.90]Yearning to know what life is for,
[00:32.50]Thirsting for something more.
[00:37.74]Though some may search in despair,
[00:43.40]God’s Word has always been there—
[00:48.70]Words that bring hope, joy that is real,
[00:53.56]Happiness I can feel.
[00:58.02](Chorus)
[00:58.36]I’ll praise Jehovah each day,
[01:03.70]Walk in his light, follow his way.
[01:08.74]I’ll give Jehovah my life,
[01:14.08]Trusting that he’ll provide.
[01:20.46]I will always feed
[01:25.54]My spiritual need.
[01:38.14]2. I know I need to make time
[01:43.86]Thinking on truths that I find,
[01:48.74]Feeding my faith, helping me see
[01:53.28]How to be truly free.
[01:58.56]Though some may choose to ignore,
[02:03.96]I’ll pray they open the door.
[02:09.48]Then they can feel true peace of mind,
[02:15.38]Happiness just like mine.
[02:19.22](Chorus)
[02:19.28]I’ll praise Jehovah each day,
[02:24.58]Walk in his light, follow his way.
[02:29.36]I’ll give Jehovah my life,
[02:35.08]Trusting that he’ll provide.
[02:42.62]I will always feed
[02:46.44]My spiritual need.
